                <span class="text-xl font-bold text-red block">86.7%</span>
                <span class="text-muted text-[11px]">GPT-1: 82.1% (+4.6%)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="border border-line p-3 bg-paper-deep">
                <span class="text-muted block mb-1">SQuAD v1.1 F1 分數</span>
                <span class="text-xl font-bold text-red block">93.2</span>
                <span class="text-muted text-[11px]">人類平均基準: 86.8 (超越人類)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 mb-0 text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">
              在 2018 年底，BERT 席捲了整座 NLP
              學界。過去數十個針對個別數據集精雕細琢的傳統模型，在一夜之間被這套雙向預訓練大模型全數推平。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside slot="rail" class="space-y-6">
          <AsideCard
